    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computer Fury:  is a dynamic combat game. Prepare to face powerful enemies using a variety of combat moves, and explore diverse digital worlds, each offering unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and Combat Gameplay: Engage in epic battles that rely on quick reflexes and smart strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting Story: Discover the secrets of the Computer Street world through an engaging story that captivates you from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the dark computer team controls everything, you find yourself a lone warrior seeking to uncover the truth behind an evil program known as &quot;Computer Fury.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing Sound Effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound effects that add depth to the experience, making it more exciting and thrilling.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computer Fury:  is a dynamic combat game. Prepare to face powerful enemies using a variety of combat moves, and explore diverse digital worlds, each offering unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and Combat Gameplay: Engage in epic battles that rely on quick reflexes and smart strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting Story: Discover the secrets of the Computer Street world through an engaging story that captivates you from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the dark computer team controls everything, you find yourself a lone warrior seeking to uncover the truth behind an evil program known as &quot;Computer Fury.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing Sound Effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound effects that add depth to the experience, making it more exciting and thrilling.</p>",
